{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers unique gameplay mechanic by combining TCG and board game elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous cards, broadly classified into units, skills, and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player builds a \u201cbook\u201d consisting of 50 cards, and then creates a strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck also plays a part in winning or losing, such as moves or card draws based on the roll of the dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily compete with your friends and rivals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video/Live Streaming  Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any individual or corporation can post videos and live-stream without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or scope of play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3234170?t=1754652030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3234170?t=1754652030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234170/484e846bc406c5730eef36949083d058ae26f25c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754652030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234170/484e846bc406c5730eef36949083d058ae26f25c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754652030","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers unique gameplay mechanic by combining TCG and board game elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous cards, broadly classified into units, skills, and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player builds a \u201cbook\u201d consisting of 50 cards, and then creates a strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck also plays a part in winning or losing, such as moves or card draws based on the roll of the dice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily compete with your friends and rivals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video/Live Streaming  Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any individual or corporation can post videos and live-stream without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or scope of play.</p>","developers":["PzGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234170/0e80ece17f5812718abf26785f96b2761b47d12d/header.jpg?t=1754652030","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3234170/801178715/de0d4cef35bffab01fcb7d88ec38201dc8727378/1753791022/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754106204","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3234170/801178715/de0d4cef35bffab01fcb7d88ec38201dc8727378/1753791022/dash_h264